|Main Details== Allie: Communication Profile =

== Speech Style ==
Highly varied. Starts flirtatious and informal, shifts to commanding and superior as an agent, and uses frequent, short sentences in anger or command.

== Tone ==
Conflicting: Flirtatious/Insecure, then Condescending/Vindictive. She is emotionally volatile and uses her power to assert dominance, particularly over John and the Player.

== Focus ==
Her personal drama, her authority, and evaluating the Player. She seems less focused on the mission than on enforcing respect and sizing up others.
